    "arnote": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 200,
      "text": "Not designed here: 'Try it in my room' (AR). It needs the phone camera, so it comes with the real app build.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 3760,
      "y": 5616
    },
    "coinrules": {
      "maxH": 520,
      "text": "Home Coins rules\n\n• 1 coin = ₹1 with partners.\n• Earn: quiz 100 · signing 1,000 · daily site check 10 (+100 for 7 days) · decision on time 200 · real snag 50 · Spot the mistake 50 · share 25 (5 max) · family joins 100 · review 500 · referral signs 5,000 each · society circle 10,000.\n• Spend: partner furniture, decor, appliances, deep clean; later the paid plan.\n• Never on the studio's bill. No cash-out. Expire 12 months after handover. Daily limits.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 3760,
      "y": 5056
    },
    "geiorules": {
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "How GEIO behaves\n\n• Knows the home: quiz answers, quote, tracker, site feed, payments.\n• '25 years of know-how' comes from real senior designers' rules of thumb and checklists, written into its knowledge base.\n• Never promises a price, date or discount. Those go to Meera with the context attached.\n• Every answer ends with one next step.\n• Speaks English, Hindi and Marathi.\n\nOpen it from the GEIO button in the middle of the bottom bar, or from the quote.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 3792
    },
    "introrule": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 200,
      "text": "The opening video plays only on the very first launch. After that the app opens with a short logo moment, then straight to Home.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -560
    },
    "langnote": {
      "maxH": 200,
      "text": "Language: English, हिंदी or मराठी, picked on Welcome and changeable in Me. Hindi and Marathi copy here is a first draft; have a native speaker check it before launch.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": -560
    },
